  "body": "Uses (5 charges).\n➡️ If Eyes Through the Veil is ready, spend 1 charge: 【Investigate】 (<wil>). Your location gets -2 shroud for this investigation. After you reveal the initial chaos token for this test, you may choose to reveal up to 2 additional chaos tokens, one at a time. If the test succeeds, for each additional token revealed this way, you may discover 1 additional clue at your location. If a non-⭐ symbol token is revealed during this test, exhaust Eyes Through the Veil.",
